WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.529 --> 00:00:02.809
Let's review what the purpose of the APIs and

1
00:00:02.809 --> 00:00:05.300
how they use the data table stored in Workato.

2
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.170
To recap,

3
00:00:06.199 --> 00:00:09.189
a manager's phone application pulls from the data table,

4
00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.489
stored in Workato,

5
00:00:10.689 --> 00:00:15.140
pending requests and sends this list and array to a mobile device.

6
00:00:15.569 --> 00:00:17.709
The mobile device does not Send any data,

7
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.200
but the recipe hands what to send to the application on the phone.

8
00:00:21.629 --> 00:00:23.370
Once a decision is made on the phone,

9
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.920
the post-decision API sends the record ID

10
00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:29.250
and the approval status back to Workato,

11
00:00:29.459 --> 00:00:33.299
which then updates the source record status to approved in the data table.